      "description": "The text 'a group of baboons is called a congress' is mapped onto the visual of baboons displaying their red genitalia. The meme creates an analogical mapping where the term 'congress' (which refers to a legislative body) is humorously and crudely associated with the anatomical feature of baboons, implying a vulgar pun. This mapping relies on the visual focus on genitalia to generate shock humor and is intended to be offensive and mocking.",
